        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba bishii toddobaad waxaa yimid Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah oo ahaa ina Eliishaamaac, oo ka mid ahaa farcankii boqornimada iyo weliba saraakiishii boqorka, isagoo toban nin wata, oo waxay Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam ugu yimaadeen Misfaah, oo halkaasay kibis ku wada cuneen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa waxaa sara joogsaday Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah iyo tobankii nin ee isaga la socday, oo Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam oo ahaa ina Shaafaan ayay seef la dheceen oo isagay dileen kaasoo boqorkii Baabuloon uu dalka taliye uga dhigay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo weliba Ismaaciil wuxuu kaloo wada laayay Yuhuuddii Gedalyaah Misfaah la joogtay, iyo reer Kaldayiinkii halkaas laga helay, kuwaasoo ahaa raggii dagaalka oo dhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo maalintii uu Gedalyaah dilay maalintii ku laba ahayd iyadoo aan ciduna weli ogayn ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayaa nimani waxay ka yimaadeen Shekem iyo Shiiloh iyo Samaariya, oo waxay ahaayeen siddeetan nin oo gadhadhkii iska xiiray, oo dharkoodiina jeexjeexay, oo jidhkoodii googooyay, oo gacmaha ku sida qurbaanno iyo foox ay guriga Rabbiga u wadaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah wuxuu Misfaah uga tegey inuu iyaga ka hor tago aawadeed, isagoo ooyaya intuu sii socday oo dhan, oo markuu iyagii la kulmay wuxuu ku yidhi, Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam u kaalaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markay magaalada dhexdeedii yimaadeen ayaa Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah kulligood wada laayay, oo isagii iyo raggii la socday meydkoodii god bay ku rideen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse waxaa dhexdoodii laga helay toban nin oo Ismaaciil ku tidhi, Ha na dilin, waayo, annagu waxaannu leennahay kayd sarreen iyo shaciir iyo saliid iyo malab ah oo duurka ku dhex qarsoon, sidaas daraaddeed iyagii wuu iska dhaafay oo walaalahood lama uu layn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba godkii uu Ismaaciil ku riday raggii uu Gedalyaah la laayay meydadkoodii oo dhan wuxuu ahaa kii uu Boqor Aasaa u samaystay cabsi uu ka qabay boqorkii dalka Israa'iil oo Bacshaa ahaa aawadeed, oo Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah wuxuu godkaas ka buuxiyey kuwii uu laayay meydkoodii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Ismaaciil wuxuu maxaabiis ahaan u kaxaystay dadka hadhay oo dhan, xataa gabdhihii boqorka iyo dadkii Misfaah ku hadhay oo dhan, kuwaasoo Nebuusaradaan oo ahaa sirkaalkii waardiyayaashu uu u dhiibay Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam. Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah maxaabiis ahaan ayuu u kaxaystay, oo wuxuu u ambabbaxay inuu reer Cammoon u gudbo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax iyo saraakiishii ciidammada ee isaga la joogtay oo dhammu markay maqleen xumaantii uu Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah sameeyey oo dhan ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayay kaxaysteen raggii oo dhan, oo waxay u keceen inay Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah la diriraan, oo isagay ka ag heleen biyihii badnaa ee Gibecoon ku yaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dadkii Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah watay oo dhammu markay arkeen Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax iyo saraakiishii ciidammada oo isaga la jiray oo dhan ayay wada farxeen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed dadkii Ismaaciil uu Misfaah maxaabbiisahaanta uga kaxaystay oo dhammu intay jeesteen ayay dib u noqdeen, oo waxay u tageen Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah Yooxaanaan wuu ka baxsaday, oo intuu siddeed nin la cararay ayuu reer Cammoon u tegey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cararkii Masar",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yooxaanaan ina Qaaree'ax iyo saraakiishii ciidammada ee isaga la jirtay oo dhammu waxay soo kexeeyeen dadkii hadhay ee uu dhammaan ka soo caymiyey Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah markuu Misfaah ku dilay Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam dabadeed, oo kuwaasu waxay ahaayeen raggii dagaalka, iyo naagihii, iyo carruurtii, iyo bohommadii ee uu ka soo celiyey Gibecoon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo iyana intay tageen ayay Geeruud Kimhaam oo Beytlaxam ku ag yiil degeen, si ay u tagaan oo ay Masar u galaan reer Kaldayiin aawadood, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maxaa yeelay, iyagay ka cabsanayeen, waayo, Ismaaciil ina Netanyaah ayaa dilay Gedalyaah ina Ahiiqaam oo boqorkii Baabuloon uu dalka taliye uga dhigay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.41.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
